{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310427","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG-statement__section_N1003A_N10037_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Writes an INTEGER or INT64 value as a 32-bit unsigned\nvalue to a MEMPTR or RAW value. This statement is analogous to the PUT-UNSIGNED-SHORT\nstatement, except with a 32-bit value. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG-statement__syntax_GC1A12N2701351\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d353493e108\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG-statement__idGDO2SV2675155\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> ) = <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A MEMPTR or RAW variable. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> is\nthe Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>), it remains the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).\nIf <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> is a MEMPTR and its region is\nnot allocated (by a SET-SIZE statement, or by a Windows DLL or Unix\nshared object entry point), the AVM generates a run-time error.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An INTEGER or INT64 value greater than 0 that indicates the\nbyte position to write <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is\nless than 1, the AVM generates a run-time error. For a RAW <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>,\nif <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is greater than the length of <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>,\nthe AVM increases the length of <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> to <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> plus the\nremaining bytes needed to store <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>. The\ngap between the original <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> length and <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is\npadded with null bytes. For a MEMPTR <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>,\nif <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is greater than the length of <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> or\ndoes not leave sufficient room to store <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>,\nthe AVM generates a run-time error.<p class=\"p\">For a RAW <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>,\nif<var class=\"keyword varname\"> position</var> is greater than the length of <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>,\nthe AVM increases the length of <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> to <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> plus the\nremaining bytes needed to store <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>. The\ngap between the original <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> length and <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is\npadded with null bytes. </p><p class=\"p\">For a MEMPTR <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var>,\nif <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is greater than the length of <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> or\ndoes not leave sufficient room to store <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>,\nthe AVM generates a run-time error.</p></dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An INTEGER or INT64 value of a constant, field, variable or\nexpression. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> is an INT64 value exceeding\nthe maximum value of an UNSIGNED-LONG, the AVM generate an overflow\nerror at run time.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG-statement__notes_GC1A12P2701395\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d353493e281\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">This\nstatement supports byte-swapping only if <var class=\"keyword varname\">destination</var> is\na MEMPTR data type. The statement will first examine the byte-order\nsetting of the MEMPTR and then swap the bytes appropriately while\nputting the data into the MEMPTR memory.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">For more information on accessing DLL routines from ABL, see <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge\nDevelopment: Programming Interfaces</cite>.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG-statement__see-also_GC1A12Q2701403\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d353493e302\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-UNSIGNED-LONG-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-UNSIGNED-LONG-function.html\">GET-UNSIGNED-LONG function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LENGTH-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LENGTH-function.html\">LENGTH function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LENGTH-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LENGTH-statement.html\">LENGTH statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RAW-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RAW-function.html\">RAW function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RAW-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RAW-statement.html\">RAW statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SET-SIZE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SET-SIZE-statement.html\">SET-SIZE statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUT-STRING-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-STRING-statement.html\">PUT-STRING statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUT-UNSIGNED-SHORT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-UNSIGNED-SHORT-statement.html\">PUT-UNSIGNED-SHORT statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310427","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-UNSIGNED-LONG-statement.html","type":"Manual"}